<section class="page-hero-dark">
<div class="container">
<span class="label label-gold">
     Greece CSD
    </span>
<h1>
     Discipline Rights &amp; Impartial Hearings
     <br/>
     in Greece CSD
    </h1>
<p class="hero-sub">
     When Greece Central School District disciplines your special education student, it must follow specific procedures to protect their rights.
    </p>
</div>
</section>
<main>
<div class="container">
<nav aria-label="District pages" class="silo-nav">
<strong>
      Greece CSD Resources:
     </strong>
